[TITLE]
SIM-24: elevated tank T1 (narrow riser, wide bowl) drains 20 gpm into junction J1
Volume curve VC: 100 ft3 per ft up to 10 ft, then 700 ft3 per ft up to 20 ft.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID  Elev  Demand
 J1  0     20

[TANKS]
;ID  Elev  InitLevel  MinLevel  MaxLevel  Diameter  MinVol  VolCurve
 T1  100   10         0         20        50        0       VC          ; 1,000 ft3 at 10 ft

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  T1  J1  1000    8     100    0      Open

[CURVES]
;ID  Level  Volume
 VC  0      0
 VC  10     1000        ; riser
 VC  20     8000        ; bowl

[TIMES]
 Duration            1:00
 Hydraulic Timestep  1:00

[REPORT]
 Summary  No

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
